OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies Russian plot to 'torch'
OL,4,Adrone factories
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied planning to "torch" UK
OL,7,Fdrone factories on behalf of Russia's
OL,8,Fintelligence services in an alleged
OL,9,Fsabotage plot.
OL,11,FJoshua Cammidge, from Swindon in
OL,12,FWiltshire, is accused of researching
OL,13,Ffour drone manufacturing sites in the
OL,14,Ftown and carrying out reconnaissance.
OL,16,FOn Friday, prosecutors told the Old
OL,17,FBailey the 31-year-old was in contact
OL,18,Fwith a British national fighting for
OL,19,FRussia in Ukraine, who he "offered to
OL,20,Fconduct sabotage" at the sites for.
